<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes comparison functions for quaternion types that take a user defined epsilon values.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_quaternion__relational_8hpp">glm/ext/quaternion_relational.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

